Synthesis of truMOF-1: A mixture of $\mathrm{Zn(NO_{3})_{2}\bullet4H_{2}O}$ $\mathrm{60~mg}$ and $\mathbf{H}_{3}\mathbf{L}$ $\mathrm{45~mg)}$ were placed in a mixed solution of DMF (10 mL), $\mathrm{CH}_{3}\mathrm{OH}$ $(0.3\mathrm{\mL})$ ) and $\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{O}$ $(0.3~\mathrm{mL})$ ), with several glass slides in a screw-capped vial, and placed in a $90^{\circ}\mathrm{C}$ oven for 2 days. The crystals grew on the glass slides and the slides with crystals were taken out of the solution and thoroughly washed with DMF and EtOH before other experiments.
Synthesis of truMOF-2: A mixture of $\mathrm{Zn(NO_{3})_{2}\bullet4H_{2}O}$ $\mathrm{\langle60\mg\rangle}$ and $\mathrm{H}_{3}\mathbf{L}$ $\mathrm{45~mg)}$ were placed in a mixed solution of DMF ( $\mathrm{10~mL)}$ and $\mathrm{CH}_{3}\mathrm{OH}\left(0.3\mathrm{\mL}\right)$ , with several glass slides in a screw-capped vial, and placed in a $90^{\circ}\mathrm{C}$ oven for 2 days. The crystals grew on the glass slides and the slides with crystals were taken out of the solution and thoroughly washed with DMF and EtOH before other experiments.
